# Task 24 — build-context exclusions for docker/Dockerfile.* (repo-root context).
# Secrets are excluded FIRST and hardest: images are built from this context, and
# a .env that leaks into a layer is as bad as committing it (CI security job
# asserts no tracked .env*, this file ensures they can't ride along untracked).
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!store/.env.example

# Dependency/build trees — regenerated inside the image; shipping the host's
# (Windows) copies would both bloat the context and break native binaries.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.keystone
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/build
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Generated Prisma clients (prisma generate runs during image build).
**/generated

# VCS + logs (context size, no build value).
.git
**/.git
logs
**/logs
logs-*
**/*.log

# Not part of any image: reference clone (never deployed), backups written by
# docker/postgres-backup.sh, and the plan/docs themselves.
openfront-storefront
backups
docs
.github
